# Review needed: Glossary term 'may' found, but target 'ເດືອນພືດສະພາ' missing;
# Highly technical error message involving database administration (PostGIS,
# superuser, extensions, devel headers). Translation needs validation by a
# technical expert familiar with Odoo and PostgreSQL/PostGIS administration in
# Lao context.
#. module: spp_base_gis
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/spp_base_gis/__init__.py:0
#, python-format, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Error, can not automatically initialize spatial postgis support. Database user may have to be superuser and postgres/postgis extensions with their devel header have to be installed. If you do not want Odoo to connect with a super user you can manually prepare your database. To do this, open a client to your database using a super user and run:\n"
"CREATE EXTENSION postgis;\n"
"CREATE EXTENSION postgis_topology;\n"
msgstr ""
"ຜິດພາດ, ບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຮອງຮັບ spatial postgis ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນອາດຈະຕ້ອງເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ສິດສູງສຸດ ແລະ ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ postgres/postgis "
"ພ້ອມດ້ວຍ devel header ຂອງພວກມັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ Odoo "
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ສິດສູງສຸດ ທ່ານສາມາດກະກຽມຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍມື. "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, "
"ເປີດໂປຣແກຣມລູກຂ່າຍໄປຫາຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສິດສູງສຸດ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການ: "
"CREATE EXTENSION postgis; CREATE EXTENSION postgis_topology;"

